{"name":"The Unit Lamp","slug":"glyph-unit-lamp","blurb":"On the trit street, Elk carries the lamp toward the bracket lamp. The mark is Unit. Click the lamp and it lights. A touch does not keep a step. A step away from the lamp is not kept. A step is kept only when the gap shrinks. The page proves its own street law on load. Glyph: The Unit Lamp.","seal":"f8283e3c91542a517c190f17aa7ff1cf1ade046b9425f03159ab04cbbf294d42"}
